Detective: Hey guys! do you have any informathon about the mudder of Nath?
Detective: : How do you guys relate from Nath?
Grand Mother: Hey! I am his Grand Mother. I was the person to find him dead. He was found out of the main door with knife staped on his stomach. I immideatly took him to Hospital and called the police.
Mike: Hey! I am his friend I know him for last 7 years. It was a unexpected death of mike I am very sad after knowing this.
Detective: Wehn did you meet him last time.
Mike: I was with him before a week of his death in a bar. I got his death information just today.
- Did you killed Nath.
	Detective: Did you kill Nath.
	Mike: Nah..., I am his very good friend. I know him for 10 years. I had cried for an hour after I got his death news. 
	Detective: What were you doing at the time of his death?
	Mike: I was in my office working on the project my boss gave me. Then I had gone to the bar to be fresh. I called a taxi to go home. I was so tired that day so I couldn't remember most of the things I had done that day. As I remember, I didn't remembered what I'd done that day.
	Detective: So, summarizing your words, you didn't killed Nath but you were in a bar the day Nath was killed.
	Mike: yes!
- Why are you sweting?
	Detective: Why are you sweting?
	Mike: It's too hot here. I don't think asking everyone who are sweting won't trace you near the killer.
	Detective: Ohh... My fault.
Sister: Hey! I am his Sister. I have been in aboard since 5 year to do Bachlor in Psychology. I came yesterday after I heard his death news. Hopefully, I could come here after my exam has just ended.
Detective: So could you guys tell me about his habit.
Grand Mother: I know him from his birth. He pretty aggressive in nature. He wants to win even a small argunment. As I have absorved so far before his death, had been comming very late being with his friend in bar. He had been using his phone for chatting and calling a lot. In his school too, he have been involved in many gang fight in the name of many girl friend. As I know his latest girl friend was Jerry after he broke up with Mira.
Detective: Can I get more information form Jerry and Mira.
Mike: Nath was in relationship with Mira for 5 years while, Jerry is his new girl friend. He have been with Jerry for this 3 month.
Detective: Did he used to talk with Mira after he broke up with her and get Jerry.
Mike: Yup, sometime.
- Tell me Mira location.
	Detective: Tell me Mira location
	Mike: I have you given you the location in google map.
	Detective: Thanks
- Can I get Nath phone.
	Detective: can I get Nath phone for investigation.
	Grand Mother: This is his phone.
	Detective: What does he usuall uses for messaging?
	Grand Mother: I don't know. May be Mike and his sister know better.
	Mike: He usually uses instagram, facebook, twiter and Whatsapp for messaging.
Detective: When did he went to bar last time?
Grand Mother: He had gone to bar the day he had found dead but he arrived earlier the day he was forund dead. He had gone out to be fresh but he had been out for long time. So, I wanted to look what he was doing. I found he was dead.
Detective: Did he used to share anything to his family?
Sister: He often calls me once a week or some times days.
Detective: What did he used to talk with you?
Sister: He used to ask about my days and sometimes he used to share his sadness like he cried a lot after his breakup and he also make me meet with his new girlfriend. I have been also introduced with his ex Mira.
Detective: How much do you know about Mira and Jerry.
Sister: Pretty good. We often share trend with each other.
Detective: He might have meet you with Mike.
Sister: of cource, I know him before I had gone abroad.
Detective: Thank you guys for information, I have recorded the conversation in my phone.
Detective: Why are you sweting Mike?
Mike: Bro, it's June.
